des social, political, religious, economic, military, medical, chemical,\nphysical, paraphysical subjects, the regulator of knowledge, principles, and whatever is\nnecessary for life, all of it is included. Even more than this, it has special instructions for spiritual enlightenment. In regulatory knowledge, the being is gradually elevated to the spiritual level.\nAnd the ultimate spiritual realization is to know that God is the source of all essences."
