          "textEn": "66\nThere is no interest in it. We have already told about creating interest towards listening to and chanting the holy word. This can be attained by serving a pure devotee of God. God reciprocates with his devotees © | When God sees that the devotee\nis eager with full devotion to enter his service and as a result, is eager to hear about him,\nthen he acts from within the devotee in such a way that the devotee easily\nreturns to him. God is more eager for us to return to Him. But most of us don't want to go back to God's abode. Only a few are those who\nwant to go back to God. But whoever wants to return to the abode of God,\nShri Krishna helps him in every way.\n\nNo one can enter the abode of God until they are free from all kinds of\nsins.\nMaterial sins arise from the desires to gain control over material nature. It is very difficult to get rid of such desires. For the devotee,\nin the path of returning to the abode of God, women and gold are the main obstacles. Many giants of the path of devotion fall victim to these temptations and thus return from the path of liberation, but\nwhen God himself helps man, then by the grace of God, the whole process becomes easy. It is not surprising to be restless after coming into contact with Kamini and Kanchan, because\nevery living being has been associated with such things for a long time--from a practical point of view, it has been associated with such things since time immemorial\nand it takes time to get rid of this foreign nature. But if someone engages in listening to the glory of God,\nthen gradually they realize their true state.\nBy the grace of God, such a devotee attains abundant power, by which he can protect himself from calamities,\nand all the misfortunes gradually recede from his mind."
