ch enters every universe; and third, they are the embodiment of milk, Vishnu, who is the supreme being of every physical\nmatter--whether it is living or non-living--all of it. The person who knows these complete forms of God\nunderstands God properly. The knower of this kind, birth, death, old age, and disease"
