ematic divine knowledge of devotional service is the greatest mercy,\nwhich can be shown towards the world. When each person is given the education to dedicate fifty percent of their accumulated gold to the service of God, then surely penance, purity,\nand compassion will automatically follow, and in this way, the three lost feet of religion will be automatically established."
