 a person becomes completely\nadorned with every spiritual object. This teaching is directly given by God in the pages of the Bhagavad Gita, In which this\nis a clear description that Lord Krishna is everything and by fully taking refuge in him, a man\nbecomes a completely pure person. With such unwavering faith towards Lord Krishna, man"
