e supreme divine bliss). Therefore, because Ishwar is the only means of realization,\nit is called Bhakti Yoga, Kevala.\nIn this context, Srila Jiva Goswami quotes a Vedic statement:\n(Eko Narayano Devah Paravaranam Param Asthe Kaivalyasanjnitah) and he refutes that God\nNarayan is Kaivalya, and the means by which a man reaches God is called Kaivalyapantha, that is,\nThe only means to reach God is said to be Kaivalyapantha. Stories related to God"
