ecause you are such a great God.\nMeaning: This expressed world is full of various types of living beings born in 8.4 million species. Some of them are better, and some are worse. In human society, man is considered the best creature, and among humans,\nalso, there are various, such as superior, inferior, equal, etc. But Narada Muni accepted that"
