ss of his heart (Hridauktanvatva), which\nis devotion. Therefore, God can only be known through the sincere eagerness of service, not through scientific or\nbeing knowledgeable or attaining yogic power through material ability. This fact is confirmed in the Bhagavad Gita,\n(18.54-55) in the following way:\n\nThe one who is Brahman, is happy, and does not grieve or worry"
